@startuml agentic-vs-autonomous-capability
title Agentic vs Autonomous Capability , The 2x2 Matrix at Capability Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Capability\n<<universal>>" as cap
class "Agentic\nCapability" as agcap
class "Autonomous\nCapability" as acap
class "Agentic + Autonomous\n<<compositional state>>" as both

cap <|-- agcap : specializes
cap <|-- acap : specializes

note left of agcap
  Agentic = yes
  Autonomous = no
end note

note right of acap
  Agentic = no
  Autonomous = yes
end note

note bottom of both
  Agentic = yes
  Autonomous = yes
  Compositional semantic state
  NOT a new concept type
end note

note bottom
  2x2 matrix per ADR-ES-013 §7 + ADR-ES-012 §14
  Four states: Conventional, Agentic, Autonomous, Both
  Orthogonal dimensions
end note
@enduml
